              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel grade 17-4 PH is a martensitic precipitation-hardening stainless steel with high strength and exhibits good corrosion resistance. This alloy is the most used of the precipitation-hardening stainless steels due to it’s reliability and desirable mechanical properties. Because of these properties, 17-4 PH is widely used by engineers in the petrochemical and food processing, pulp and paper, aerospace and many other markets."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel 17-4 PH Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 5643](https://titanium.com/ams-5643-specification/) , [AMS 6279](https://titanium.com/ams-6279-specification/) , [AMS 6875](https://titanium.com/ams-6875-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[ASTM A484](https://titanium.com/astm-a484-specification/) , [ASTM A564](https://titanium.com/astm-a564-specification/) , [ASTM F899](https://titanium.com/astm-f899-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel 17-4 PH products offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Alloy 17-4 PH Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-stainless-steel-round-bar)"
